# #1264 fix 2c: these .log files are FIXTURES, not boot output.
#
# The repository root ignores `*.log` (.gitignore:62), which is right for every
# other .log on this tree and exactly wrong here: `ring_table._boot_stems`
# discovers a boot by the literal suffixes `.front.log` / `.P.log` / `.D.log`,
# so the fixture cannot be renamed without teaching the production code a test
# file extension. Un-ignoring them HERE, scoped to this directory, keeps that
# coupling where it belongs.
#
# Without this the fixtures would be silently skipped by `git add`, the suite
# would pass on the box that built them and fail on every other -- the precise
# failure mode fix 2c exists to remove.
!*.log
